- Hey, check it out.


00:06:47.959 --> 00:06:49.961
Look, look, look.
Somebody died over here.


00:06:50.099 --> 00:06:51.618
Let me see. Let me see. Oh!


00:06:51.756 --> 00:06:52.964
- Who was it?
- Anybody we know?


00:06:53.102 --> 00:06:54.621
- Fresh or not fresh?
- [sniffing]


00:06:54.759 --> 00:06:55.829
Smells pretty good.


00:06:55.967 --> 00:06:57.417
[sputters] Tastes terrible!


00:06:57.555 --> 00:06:58.797
- Oh, it's waking up.
- Hey, it's waking up.


00:06:58.935 --> 00:07:00.178
