Ah, thank goodness.


00:07:39.562 --> 00:07:40.563
[whirring]


00:07:40.701 --> 00:07:42.910
♪ ♪


00:07:48.398 --> 00:07:50.090
- ANIMAL: The monster!
- ANIMAL 2: The monster!


00:07:50.228 --> 00:07:51.885
[animals screaming]


00:07:52.023 --> 00:07:53.852
ANIMAL 3:
The monster!


00:07:53.990 --> 00:07:56.683
